@SaveMyMeal_Host = http://localhost:5106

### 1. Test Root / Health
GET {{SaveMyMeal_Host}}/
Accept: application/json

### 2. Inscription Utilisateur (Client)
POST {{SaveMyMeal_Host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "jean_dupont",
  "email": "jean.dupont@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "role": "Client"
}

### 3. Connexion
POST {{SaveMyMeal_Host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "emailOrUsername": "jean.dupont@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 4. Liste de tous les restaurants
GET {{SaveMyMeal_Host}}/api/restaurants
Accept: application/json

### 5. Liste des plats disponibles
GET {{SaveMyMeal_Host}}/api/meals?onlyAvailable=true
Accept: application/json

### 6. Offres intelligentes anti-gaspillage (Smart Discounts)
GET {{SaveMyMeal_Host}}/api/offers
Accept: application/json

### 7. Vérification prix intelligent pour un plat
GET {{SaveMyMeal_Host}}/api/offers/1/smart-price
Accept: application/json

### 8. Création d'une commande
POST {{SaveMyMeal_Host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clientId": 1,
  "restaurantId": 1,
  "items": [
    {
      "mealId": 1,
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ],
  "pointsToRedeem": 0
}

### 9. Validation du QR Code lors du retrait en restaurant
POST {{SaveMyMeal_Host}}/api/qrcodes/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "codeValue": "SMM-ORD-000001-A1B2C3",
  "restaurantId": 1
}

### 10. Consulter les points de fidélité
GET {{SaveMyMeal_Host}}/api/loyalty/1
Accept: application/json
